  "id": "list_building_pts",
  "title": "LIST Building Pts",
  "description": "LIST Building Pts: LIST product `LIST_BUILDING_PTS`, statewide. 179,989 features, multi-point (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per `LIST_GUID`, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2023-06-08. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LIST Building Pts\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
